                      ),
                    ],
                  ),
                  child: const Row(
                    mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,
                    children: [
                      Icon(
                        Icons.chat_bubble_outline_rounded,
                        color: Colors.white,
                        size: 20,
                      ),
                      SizedBox(width: 8),
                      Text(
                        'Contact on WhatsApp',
                        style: TextStyle(
                          fontSize: 16,
